Homepage: https://github.com/atgreen/gloopy

Package: gloopy
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: scriptable, composition-as-repo DAW
 Gloopy is a linear-arranger DAW driven end to end by an OSC + gRPC control API
 over a diff-friendly composition-as-repo text format. It hosts VST3/LV2 plugins,
 ships a bundled Surge XT synth, and stores projects as plain, version-controllable
 text.
